    "@startuml\ntitle BF-06B - Supplier Return Handling\n\n|Accountant|\nstart\n:Create supplier return request;\n\n|WMSD|\n:Record supplier, original receipt,\nlot, location, quantity and reason;\n\n|Inventory Staff|\n:Isolate goods awaiting supplier return;\n\n|WMSD|\n:Exclude isolated quantity\nfrom usable inventory;\n\n|Store Owner|\n:Review supplier return request;\n\nif (Return approved?) then (Yes)\n\n  |WMSD|\n  :Record approval decision;\n\n  |Inventory Staff|\n  :Record supplier return dispatch;\n\n  |WMSD|\n  :Reduce supplier-return inventory;\n  :Record return movement history;\n  :Complete supplier return;\n\nelse (No)\n\n  |WMSD|\n  :Record rejection decision;\n\n  |Inventory Staff|\n  :Reclassify isolated goods;\n\n  |WMSD|\n  :Update inventory status;\n\nendif\n\nstop\n@enduml"
